flowchart LR
  PR[Pull Request] --> Checks[Build / Unit / Static Analysis]
  Checks --> SQLTests[SQL Integration / Migrations]
  SQLTests --> E2E[Playwright E2E]
  E2E --> Scan[Dependency / Secret / Security Scans]
  Scan --> Artifact[Immutable Artifact]
  Artifact --> Stage[Staging via OIDC]
  Stage --> Verify[Smoke / Health / Restore checks]
  Verify --> Approval[Release Approval]
  Approval --> Deploy[Production Deploy]
  Deploy --> Observe[Post-deploy SLO / Error monitoring]
